      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَاشِطٌ</span></b>  <i>A slaughterer</i> [or <i>skinner</i>] <i>of camels;</i>
as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَشَّاطٌ</span></b> . (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also, [its pls.] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَشَطَةٌ</span>
(Lth, K,) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَاشِطُونَ</span> (M, TA) The <i>owners of
a skinned camel.</i> (Lth, M, K.)

